      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOODBYE MATE (2) is a handy type who was well below best latest at Nowra, finishing fourth (21.25) in a Mix 1/2/3. Generally fast to begin but always back from the wide draw last time. Has a solid record from this box including four wins and a minor placing. Better than last start and worth following up. JAMAL WICK (1) finished third (23.02) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Better than last start and can bounce back. MAXIMUS MERIDIUS (4) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (23.10) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Expected to run well. SUPREME LADY (5) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
